    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Trauma is one of the leading causes of death and disability not only in population in Pakistan but also in those across the globe. Trauma cases are probably more amenable to treatment than cancer, stroke and some heart diseases, if managed appropriately. In South Asia trauma related mortality is increasing and, according to WHO, by the year 2020 trauma will be the leading cause of productive life loss for both developed nations and developing nations.",
